ort introduced. \n (Pentagon: Martha Raddatz)  Report from an independent panel on the responsibility for the abuse at the Abu Ghraib prison in Iraq examined; details given of the findings singling out Joint Chiefs of Staff chairman Gen. Richard Myers&#134;, US Central Command commander Gen. Tommy Franks & coalition troops in Iraq commander Lt. Gen. Ricardo Sanchez, military police brigade head Gen. Janis Karpinski&#134; & military intelligence brigade head Col. Thomas Pappas.  [Panel chairman James SCHLESINGER&#134;, panel member Tillie FOWLER&#134;- say there is institutional & personal responsibility up the chain of command; note the sadism on the \"Animal House\" night shift.]", "segment_duration": 150, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63340.0", "legacy_segment_id": 763330, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "w6IWJSM8S1", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-24", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1710, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 763327, "segment_id": "dHlwUuM7yX", "segment_broadcast_id": "w6IWJSM8S1", "segment_title": "Iraq / Al-Sadr Revolt / Najaf", "segment_description": "(Studio: Charles Gibson)  The ongoing siege of Najaf, Iraq, updated; scenes shown.", "segment_duration": 30, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63490.0", "legacy_segment_id": 763331, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "w6IWJSM8S1", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-24", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcas